# Server Code Organization

Future server-only logic belongs under:

```txt
src/server/db/
src/server/storage/
src/server/config/
src/server/security/
src/server/files/
```

Route handlers should orchestrate server modules. Do not place database, filesystem, env, password, token, or path logic directly in route handlers.

Server-only modules that access filesystem, database, env vars, password hashing, or tokens should import:

```ts
import "server-only";
```

Future environment validation belongs in `src/server/config/env.ts` with Zod.
